Introduction :
--------------

Learning JAVA or any other programming language with a proper approach, using the latest tools and technologies, with company standards, is a right way to begin your coding journey. So,

i) Find a suitable and reliable guide or an institute or a web platform or a youtube channel to start coding in the right way.

ii) Study well with a sheduled time table to maintain the consistency in your preparation.

iii) Have some break in-between to refresh and energize yourself to work more efficiently.

iv) If you are facing problem while understanding the concepts in the initial stages of learning, take it slow, rewatch the lectures and try to get a hang of the topics.

v) Practice more by writing the code on a sheet of paper rather than typing to increase the chances of memorizing the correct syntax of a program.

vi) Make a detailed notes in your handwriting and a digital soft copy of the same for better understandaing and ease of use.

vii) Enjoy the process of learning as to not get bored or overwhelmed by the sheer number of concepts and topics to cover.

viii) Lets take one proper step at a time, with determination and motivation.

ix) Always retain the desire to code and build something new and interesting.

x) Best of luck, everyone.
